window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Fallon is an ice princess, or so everyone calls her—everyone but him.</b></p> <p>Kage has been obsessed with the dark folk singer for as long as he can remember, and after a chance encounter, he vows to make her his.</p> <p>However, loving Fallon is no easy feat. She breaks hearts, refusing to claim them, and when her past comes into the light, the reason why is obvious.</p> <p>Can Fallon and Kage survive the ghosts that haunt her?</p> <p>Will Fallon embrace her pain and finally speak her truth, or will she simply melt away?</p> <p>Find out tonight in a surprise live broadcast, where the past doesn't always stay dead.</p> <p>Long may she riot!</p>"; 
